  "html": "<h3><strong>I recently got DALL-E 2 access</strong></h3><p>DALL-E 2 is a new AI system from <a href=\"http://openai.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI</a> that can create realistic images and art from a description in natural language. </p><p>It indexes 650 billion images from the internet and has created its <em>own</em> models for what it thinks things are. It’s like magic. </p><p>And it’s absolutely blowing my mind… </p><p>I wanted to share some of the images that the AI has created along with the prompts for them, and a prompt is a sentence that’s 400 characters or less, that describes the image you want.</p><p>For example, you might <em>prompt</em> DALL-E with the following: </p><ul><li><p>Monkey is a space suit </p></li><li><p>An oil painting of a building in the 18th century </p></li><li><p>3D rendering of a cute fish in a comfy chair </p></li></ul><p><strong>Behold</strong>. Here’s what it came up with after I gave it the following prompts…</p><blockquote><h3><strong>Racoon playing chess in style of Rembrandt</strong> </h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/7cb36b574b5b930046cf5a1c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/2a7b4008b857b1c2e103f25a.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>Photo of a young greek woman in the style of Dorothea Lange</strong> </h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/1d148327838f8ddb86b1647a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/202827854ff5a3313b916356.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>A painting of a fox in the style of Starry Night</strong></h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/a6a90223802200ffda1f293f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/d567cf4da1b5cb1da8ac892a.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>Teddy bears shopping for groceries in Japan</strong></h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/62966e401f1d97668b52f26b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/473ab242717a4b6eec9cd654.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>Watermelon Pokémon</strong></h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/6cf2f5fd02e7e964e9e86623.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/e8c9fc5ef23f201ee0ffb31c.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>A view of a pyramid made of spaghetti surrounded by palm trees, digital art</strong></h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/14e41f5e70e19952a13f43a2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/4d84b0886d39e6b3017f2e0d.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>Bob Ross eating a painting</strong></h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/a91043fea0e8014d53424820.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/dfacb2a892af9260fb958e79.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>A group of ducks in tilt shift</strong> </h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/9237ed744c879e6d81464d05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/19e086e58ec833299604fcdd.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>Horror photo of a walrus in London</strong> </h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/811aa72eff6d6d22c0546098.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/492359283ac9d35a0a33dfa2.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><p></p><blockquote><h3><strong>A cyberpunk version of a gaucho in Argentina</strong> </h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/f7e6021f5b5180e7654c7dfe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/8314b19b0753b8ccb0e41313.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div></blockquote><div><hr /></div><p>If you find my blog moderately interesting or useful, feel free to share it with anyone you know. </p><p></p>",
